# ============================================================
# Public repository: paper PDFs and metadata only.
# Everything else stays in the local Dropbox archive.
# ============================================================

# No LaTeX sources are published
*.tex
*.sty
*.cls
*.bst
*.bib

# Original sources, including editorial correspondence
# (referee reports, response letters, intermediate drafts)
PAPERS/*/latex/

# PDFs are not kept here: they are published by the website repository
# (fabiofurini.github.io) and the full archive lives in Dropbox.
PAPERS/*/open/
PAPERS/*/pdf/

# Superseded working trees
/LATEX/
/PDF/
/LIST_OF_PUBBLICATIONS/
/EXTRA/

# Build artefacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.blg
*.bbl
.DS_Store
.directory
PIANO_PAPERI.md
docs/
